WEBVTT

00:47.172 --> 00:49.299
Every life is a work of art.

01:01.478 --> 01:04.522
And it becomes complete
when all the pieces come together.

01:17.911 --> 01:19.788
Why did you get up? Go back to bed.

01:28.129 --> 01:29.380
Mom.

01:29.464 --> 01:32.675
You know what? I made a new friend today,

01:32.759 --> 01:33.968
and he has the same name.

01:34.052 --> 01:35.762
I'm tired.

01:43.645 --> 01:46.314
I told you to sleep first
since I come home late.

01:54.906 --> 01:56.991
My life couldn't be complete

01:58.326 --> 02:01.204
because of a piece I've never had before.

02:48.042 --> 02:49.836
I couldn't see why though.

02:49.919 --> 02:52.547
Listen to your teacher, okay?

02:52.630 --> 02:54.215
Let's go!

02:55.466 --> 02:56.634
Hey!

02:56.718 --> 02:58.553
Mom, he's my friend Ji-ung.

02:58.636 --> 02:59.846
- I see.
- Hi.

02:59.929 --> 03:02.473
Hi, are you Ji-ung?

03:02.557 --> 03:04.684
I'm Ung's mom.

03:04.767 --> 03:07.061
- A piece everyone has…
- Nice to meet you, ma'am.

03:07.145 --> 03:09.314
You look so bright.

03:11.024 --> 03:13.651
Thank you for being Ung's friend.

03:15.028 --> 03:17.822
- …and isn't that hard to obtain.
- Hold hands with your friend on your way.

03:17.906 --> 03:21.034
I didn't know why I was the only one
who didn't have that piece.

03:24.078 --> 03:25.371
Here you go.

03:25.455 --> 03:26.581
All right.

03:27.165 --> 03:27.999
Let's see.

03:30.335 --> 03:31.210
Here.

03:32.253 --> 03:33.463
Are you eating alone again?

03:37.091 --> 03:39.802
Here you go. Put the bowl outside
when you're done.

03:40.345 --> 03:43.389
The memories I have of my childhood…

03:46.059 --> 03:47.060
…are of being alone…

03:59.405 --> 04:01.324
or being with a friend who was alone.

04:08.414 --> 04:12.627
And she was also there a few times.

04:24.430 --> 04:25.640
That was it.

04:28.351 --> 04:29.560
And when time passed…

04:31.562 --> 04:34.065
and I grew old enough
to remember everything,

04:48.705 --> 04:50.456
I became numb to a lot of things.

04:54.460 --> 04:55.795
But that doesn't mean

04:57.171 --> 04:59.340
that I got used to everything.

05:01.342 --> 05:02.677
And around that time…

05:04.345 --> 05:05.638
You don't have a dad either?

05:05.722 --> 05:08.057
No. You don't either?

05:10.184 --> 05:11.644
Then do you live with your mom?

05:11.728 --> 05:12.854
Yes.

05:13.563 --> 05:15.273
It must have been tough for you.

05:15.356 --> 05:18.943
Why would it be tough for me?
My mom's the one who suffered.

05:19.027 --> 05:20.903
She had a fever last night,

05:20.987 --> 05:23.114
so I told her not to go to work.

05:23.197 --> 05:24.824
But she never listens to me.

05:24.907 --> 05:27.452
She makes a huge fuss whenever
I get sick, though.

05:28.369 --> 05:30.038
You two must be close.

05:30.121 --> 05:32.707
How can we not be?
All we have is each other.

05:33.833 --> 05:37.337
Anyway, I told our homeroom teacher
that I'm going home early,

05:37.420 --> 05:39.005
so tell the other teachers for me.

05:40.673 --> 05:42.175
We have exams tomorrow though.

05:42.258 --> 05:45.887
My mom will yell if she hears
I came home because she was sick,

05:45.970 --> 05:47.722
but she'll secretly be pleased.

05:47.805 --> 05:49.557
She can't live without me.

05:50.725 --> 05:52.310
- I'll get going, then.
- Okay.

05:54.479 --> 05:55.605
So I got curious.

05:57.815 --> 06:00.151
I wanted to know the reason why I couldn't

06:01.444 --> 06:02.653
have that piece.

06:38.773 --> 06:40.775
Mom, can you…

06:47.490 --> 06:49.784
Can you live without me?

07:04.757 --> 07:06.592
Why are we living like this?

07:08.553 --> 07:11.055
Why do we have to pretend like we hate--

07:11.139 --> 07:12.849
Without you…

07:14.934 --> 07:17.061
I wouldn't be living like this.

07:24.861 --> 07:26.529
Without you…

07:29.323 --> 07:30.575
I wouldn't be living…

07:32.452 --> 07:34.745
such a pathetic life.

07:38.624 --> 07:40.918
That's when I realized…

07:42.712 --> 07:46.841
that I was a useless piece in her life.

07:48.301 --> 07:49.969
The thing I wanted so desperately

07:50.970 --> 07:53.681
was hell for her.

08:00.104 --> 08:03.900
So I decided that
I would never have that piece.

08:05.568 --> 08:07.737
My life wasn't a work of art.

08:09.363 --> 08:11.073
It was just an episode

08:11.699 --> 08:15.661
of a boring documentary series
that no one watches.

08:15.745 --> 08:19.123
EPISODE 15
THREE IDIOTS

08:23.669 --> 08:26.964
Yes, I went to the gallery
to check something.

08:27.048 --> 08:28.466
I'm heading back now.

08:29.592 --> 08:31.385
Go inside and get some rest.

08:31.469 --> 08:33.179
I'll be home soon. It's cold outside.

08:33.262 --> 08:34.180
All right.

08:48.611 --> 08:50.363
Let's not give each other presents.

08:50.446 --> 08:52.823
The culture of giving gifts
on anniversaries

08:52.907 --> 08:54.325
just makes people spend money.

08:54.408 --> 08:55.701
It's what's on the inside that counts.

08:55.785 --> 08:58.246
I think spending money
on gifts is meaningless.

08:59.830 --> 09:01.332
But back then,

09:01.916 --> 09:05.419
I only said that because
I didn't want to take up your time.

09:06.587 --> 09:08.798
So you actually wanted me
to come pick you up.

09:08.881 --> 09:09.799
Yes.

09:19.225 --> 09:20.560
May I help you?

09:20.643 --> 09:21.602
Oh, yes.

09:21.686 --> 09:24.021
Are you buying a gift for your girlfriend?

09:24.647 --> 09:25.898
Yes.

09:25.982 --> 09:29.443
What kind of style does she like?

09:30.236 --> 09:32.863
Well, she's really pretty.

09:33.614 --> 09:35.074
I see…

09:35.157 --> 09:39.328
I mean, what style of clothes
or accessories does she wear?

09:39.412 --> 09:41.372
Right…

09:42.415 --> 09:44.584
Neat and tidy?

09:44.667 --> 09:46.752
I see. Neat and tidy.

10:33.674 --> 10:34.884
What are you doing?

10:36.177 --> 10:38.304
Putting a bell on a cat.

10:54.779 --> 10:57.531
The store was having a huge sale.

10:57.615 --> 10:58.991
They said I should get one.

10:59.784 --> 11:02.995
But I thought it would look better
on you than me.

11:04.497 --> 11:05.456
It's pretty.

11:06.290 --> 11:07.124
What?

11:08.334 --> 11:09.460
Thanks.

11:11.420 --> 11:14.423
I paid full price for it
and it took me an hour to pick.

11:17.218 --> 11:18.260
I got you earrings too.

11:18.844 --> 11:19.804
Try these on.

11:35.111 --> 11:37.488
- Do you like them?
- Yes.

11:41.158 --> 11:42.493
Should we

11:42.576 --> 11:45.496
hang out at home all day
instead of going out?

11:45.996 --> 11:47.206
Yes.

11:48.916 --> 11:51.168
You know that's what I'm best at.

11:56.257 --> 12:00.010
A MIDSUMMER NIGHT'S DREAM

12:02.930 --> 12:04.723
You're done reading already?

12:18.028 --> 12:20.072
Why did you make so much?

12:20.656 --> 12:22.616
Right. I made more than I thought.

12:22.700 --> 12:24.827
How will we finish this?

12:24.910 --> 12:26.454
We can.

12:26.537 --> 12:27.913
It looks good, right?

12:29.331 --> 12:30.416
It looks tasty.

12:31.292 --> 12:32.418
I'm so full.

12:32.501 --> 12:34.378
Me too. I'm so full.

12:34.462 --> 12:35.463
Look.

12:35.546 --> 12:36.672
Look at my stomach.

12:38.757 --> 12:40.384
- Are you okay?
- Yes.

12:40.468 --> 12:42.052
Let's decide who does the dishes.

12:42.136 --> 12:43.179
- Rock, paper, scissors.
- Rock, paper, scissors.

12:48.767 --> 12:50.769
I'm not done yet.

12:58.319 --> 12:59.320
Are you done?

13:01.405 --> 13:02.490
All right.

13:05.910 --> 13:07.328
One, two, three.

13:11.248 --> 13:12.416
Why are you laughing?

13:13.834 --> 13:17.129
Jjongjjong looks so ugly!

13:17.213 --> 13:20.966
No, he looks adorable!

13:23.677 --> 13:25.012
Hey!

13:28.557 --> 13:29.642
Hey!

13:29.725 --> 13:30.851
I'm not doing this.

13:30.935 --> 13:32.645
Hey, these are expensive!

13:34.271 --> 13:35.773
Darn it.

13:41.362 --> 13:43.322
Let's not watch a documentary.

13:43.405 --> 13:45.783
Why? I wanted to watch this.

13:45.866 --> 13:47.076
Aren't you sick of them?

13:51.497 --> 13:53.999
- What do you want to watch?
- Let's see what's on.

13:55.584 --> 13:56.961
That one!

14:16.313 --> 14:17.481
SHOP FOR LUXURY ITEMS ON
TREN:BE

14:17.565 --> 14:20.192
HOT ITEMS THIS WINTER

14:22.653 --> 14:24.446
It's cold now.

14:25.155 --> 14:26.740
I should get a scarf.

14:27.366 --> 14:28.701
This one.

14:30.744 --> 14:31.829
BUY NOW, SHOPPING CART

14:34.248 --> 14:35.958
- What are you doing?
- What?

14:37.459 --> 14:38.627
Nothing.

14:41.171 --> 14:44.758
Come to think of it,
you took a shower here last time too.

14:45.509 --> 14:46.927
This is still a guy's house.

14:47.011 --> 14:48.679
So? It's your house.

14:48.762 --> 14:50.306
We weren't even dating back then.

14:52.099 --> 14:53.183
That's an enthusiastic greeting.

14:54.059 --> 14:57.271
Oh, when we said we'd be friends?

14:57.354 --> 15:00.941
You're not doing that
at all of your friends' homes, are you?

15:02.318 --> 15:03.694
Why aren't you answering?

15:04.278 --> 15:06.280
I did that to seduce you.

15:09.408 --> 15:11.702
You're such a cunning desert fox.

15:11.785 --> 15:14.705
Hey, you're just supposed to say "fox."

15:14.788 --> 15:16.332
That sounds worse for some reason.

15:16.916 --> 15:18.500
You've changed, Yeon-su.

15:19.001 --> 15:22.129
- Dry my hair for me.
- What?

15:22.838 --> 15:23.881
Dry my hair.

15:23.964 --> 15:27.635
Hey, can't you even dry your own hair?
How could you…

15:27.718 --> 15:29.929
My goodness.

15:38.687 --> 15:41.398
All dried, ma'am.

15:41.482 --> 15:44.485
Thank you. My right ear is hot, though.

15:44.568 --> 15:46.570
But your hair is perfectly dry.

15:47.154 --> 15:49.990
You're not going to keep asking me
to do this for you, are you?

15:51.909 --> 15:53.994
Keep doing it for me.

15:54.078 --> 15:57.665
My gosh. How are you going
to live without me?

15:58.624 --> 15:59.750
Jeez.

16:02.002 --> 16:04.004
You're acting strange again.

16:04.088 --> 16:06.882
What are you trying to do now?

16:09.760 --> 16:10.761
It's so peaceful.

16:12.137 --> 16:14.431
See? It's nice to not be fighting.

16:16.684 --> 16:20.020
What goes through your mind
when things are like this?

16:20.980 --> 16:21.814
Well…

16:22.773 --> 16:24.984
Not much.

16:25.651 --> 16:27.736
Just "This is nice." Stuff like that.

16:29.405 --> 16:31.365
Whenever I feel this happy,

16:32.700 --> 16:34.076
I get anxious.

16:35.494 --> 16:36.537
Why?

16:37.454 --> 16:40.457
I get worried
that I'll ruin everything again.

16:45.129 --> 16:47.881
That won't happen. Don't worry.

16:51.301 --> 16:52.594
Yeon-su.

16:57.307 --> 16:59.101
No. I'll tell you next time.

17:11.030 --> 17:13.115
ENROLLMENT GUIDE
SCHOOL OF ARCHITECTURE

17:19.747 --> 17:22.082
Why did you order so much stuff?

17:22.875 --> 17:25.502
But why are they all women's…
Are these all for Yeon-su?

17:25.586 --> 17:27.421
I don't think I ordered that many.

17:27.504 --> 17:30.132
You're trying so hard
to look like a sweet boyfriend.

17:30.215 --> 17:33.886
Do you really think she'll be happy
when she receives all this?

17:33.969 --> 17:35.596
She likes gifts more than I thought.

17:35.679 --> 17:38.348
Too many gifts will be overwhelming.

17:38.432 --> 17:40.350
You're so clueless, Ung.

17:40.934 --> 17:42.227
There's one for you.

17:42.311 --> 17:43.854
Where? What is it?

17:47.858 --> 17:49.234
I see.

17:50.027 --> 17:51.111
This?

17:52.071 --> 17:54.281
It's a bit smaller than the others,

17:54.907 --> 17:56.116
but thanks.

17:59.078 --> 18:02.956
Right, Ung. We got the brochure. Ta-da!

18:04.041 --> 18:07.419
It looks good, doesn't it?
It's finally tonight. Are you ready, Ung?

18:08.670 --> 18:11.256
We'll be making history
with a night exhibition.

18:12.049 --> 18:13.425
Is Yeon-su coming today?

18:14.009 --> 18:16.595
- She's coming on the last day.
- Why?

18:16.678 --> 18:18.430
There will be journalists,

18:18.514 --> 18:20.974
and a lot of people will recognize us
because of the documentary.

18:21.058 --> 18:23.977
I'm okay with it, but she said
she doesn't want to steal the spotlight.

18:24.061 --> 18:26.230
Yeon-su is so mature.

18:26.313 --> 18:28.107
She's so thoughtful.

18:29.608 --> 18:31.401
What could this be?

18:33.362 --> 18:35.114
Why won't it open?

18:39.243 --> 18:40.494
- Eun-ho.
- Yes?

18:41.161 --> 18:43.914
I need to tell you something
when the exhibit's over.

18:43.997 --> 18:45.541
What is it? Just tell me now.

18:45.624 --> 18:48.293
I'll tell you after the exhibit ends.

18:48.377 --> 18:51.839
All right.
But why can't I get the tape off?

18:51.922 --> 18:54.967
Do you have long nails?
Can you open this for me?

18:56.677 --> 18:58.053
What is it though?

18:58.887 --> 19:01.890
I don't remember.
There was a special sale or something.

19:01.974 --> 19:06.687
Six, five, four, three, two…

19:08.188 --> 19:09.273
Sol-i!

19:10.732 --> 19:11.859
What do I do with you?

19:11.942 --> 19:13.569
What are you doing after work?

19:15.362 --> 19:17.739
Why? Why do you want to know…

19:19.741 --> 19:21.201
what I'm doing?

19:21.285 --> 19:23.620
What? Well, it's Ung's exhibit.

19:23.704 --> 19:25.080
Come if you're not busy.

19:25.164 --> 19:27.791
It'll be late at night,
so you can come after work.

19:27.875 --> 19:28.876
Will you be there?

19:28.959 --> 19:30.335
Of course. I'm his manager.

19:31.837 --> 19:33.881
Right. Of course.

19:36.091 --> 19:38.093
You're being so obvious, Eun-ho.

19:38.760 --> 19:39.720
What?

19:39.803 --> 19:42.014
Are you coming or not?
Do you want a ticket?

19:42.097 --> 19:45.142
Sure. Leave it here.

19:47.519 --> 19:49.605
Why are you acting so strange?

19:50.814 --> 19:51.899
Are you sick?

19:53.066 --> 19:55.444
No, why?

19:55.527 --> 19:58.071
Why are your eyes like this?

20:00.407 --> 20:02.618
Anyway, I should get going.

20:02.701 --> 20:06.079
And tell me in advance if you're coming.
It'll run for three days.

20:06.788 --> 20:07.915
Bye.

20:10.209 --> 20:11.251
Bye.

20:11.919 --> 20:12.920
See you.

20:19.676 --> 20:22.888
Having a crush is terribly painful.

20:23.472 --> 20:24.973
I know it so well.

20:28.018 --> 20:29.269
You poor boy.

20:32.439 --> 20:33.941
GO-OH'S EXHIBITION,
WHILE THE CITY SLEEPS, OPENS

20:34.024 --> 20:35.150
IT WILL BE A NIGHT-TIME EXHIBIT

20:39.196 --> 20:41.073
- I'm not going.
- What?

20:41.156 --> 20:43.867
Where? Are you trying
to bail on another schedule?

20:43.951 --> 20:45.744
No, it's not that.

20:45.827 --> 20:47.120
Jeez, you startled me.

20:47.204 --> 20:50.040
I'm always so anxious these days
because of you.

20:50.123 --> 20:52.584
Right, you have the shoot
for the documentary this weekend.

20:53.252 --> 20:54.586
It's taking longer than I thought.

20:54.670 --> 20:56.296
It's the last episode.

20:56.380 --> 20:57.923
I'll give you the script later.

21:01.593 --> 21:03.303
- Chi-seong.
- Yes?

21:04.888 --> 21:07.849
- I'm sorry.
- What? Why?

21:07.933 --> 21:10.936
Sorry about what?
What are you thinking of doing?

21:11.895 --> 21:14.106
No, it's not for what I'm going to do.

21:14.189 --> 21:17.317
I'm sorry for what I did.
I acted impulsively.

21:18.402 --> 21:20.237
Couldn't you say that first?

21:20.320 --> 21:22.489
You startled me
by apologizing out of the blue.

21:23.156 --> 21:24.449
I won't startle you anymore.

21:26.994 --> 21:29.663
What's gotten into you?
This is making me more nervous.

21:30.706 --> 21:34.251
I'm going to do my best
to live a normal life now.

21:36.795 --> 21:37.838
Right.

21:38.755 --> 21:40.924
I take back my promise not to startle you.

21:41.008 --> 21:44.803
- I'll give you a couple more shocks.
- Can't you just tell me in advance?

21:44.886 --> 21:46.555
So I can take some calming pills.

22:03.780 --> 22:04.740
Hey.

22:06.116 --> 22:07.159
What are you doing?

22:08.076 --> 22:08.994
Is Mr. Kim inside?

22:10.203 --> 22:13.749
Hasn't he said
anything about thanking me yet?

22:13.832 --> 22:16.209
He must be grateful
after seeing the ratings.

22:16.293 --> 22:19.504
I don't think he's in a situation
to do that right now.

22:19.588 --> 22:22.049
Why? I'm sure he's not busy.

22:22.132 --> 22:24.676
I heard he finished editing everything.

22:27.637 --> 22:30.098
What's with him? Did someone die?

22:31.016 --> 22:34.311
I don't know. He's not even
going home these days.

22:34.394 --> 22:37.439
He acted like that before,
but it seems pretty serious this time.

22:38.815 --> 22:43.320
He's becoming more and more like Dong-il.

22:43.820 --> 22:45.280
Mr. Park?

22:45.363 --> 22:48.033
Yes. He's acting exactly like him
when he's out of it.

22:48.700 --> 22:50.869
Mr. Park isn't like that though.

22:52.204 --> 22:56.291
Don't even get me started.
He's worse than him at times.

22:56.374 --> 23:01.004
He stays cooped up in the editing room
whenever something happens.

23:02.506 --> 23:04.633
Let's go. Leave him be.

23:04.716 --> 23:06.093
Why don't we get some coffee?

23:06.176 --> 23:08.261
We should give him some alone time.

23:09.304 --> 23:10.180
Come on.

23:12.557 --> 23:14.142
Come on, let's go.

23:14.226 --> 23:15.310
Okay.

23:23.819 --> 23:25.070
They say

23:25.654 --> 23:26.655
I'm going to die.

23:27.697 --> 23:29.366
I'm going to die soon.

23:30.408 --> 23:31.660
So…

23:33.036 --> 23:35.038
please film me before I do.

23:35.789 --> 23:36.706
Please do that.

23:51.012 --> 23:53.306
- Thanks, Chae-ran.
- That's for Ji-ung.

23:53.390 --> 23:56.143
Why would you give coffee
to someone who uses all our electricity?

23:56.893 --> 23:59.771
Don't you feel sorry for him?
He's been in there for days.

23:59.855 --> 24:02.315
I feel sorry for myself
for having him on my team.

24:02.399 --> 24:03.608
See you. Thanks for this.

24:12.242 --> 24:14.953
Mr. Park is definitely
not the kind of person you said.

24:15.745 --> 24:19.749
Even if he doesn't act like it,
he cares about Mr. Kim dearly.

24:19.833 --> 24:22.085
He cares about him a lot.

24:22.169 --> 24:24.004
I've never seen him do that though.

24:24.504 --> 24:28.091
Do you know why Mr. Kim never quit
when he was an assistant producer?

24:28.175 --> 24:32.554
NEW NOYANGPO FISH MARKET

24:34.931 --> 24:36.141
FIGHT AGAINST FORCED DEMOLITION

24:36.224 --> 24:37.517
WE'RE JOINING THE FIGHT

24:37.601 --> 24:38.602
PROTECT OUR MARKET

24:38.685 --> 24:39.936
THE FISH MARKET IS OUR HOME

24:41.980 --> 24:44.399
Why did you bring such a useless kid here?

24:44.482 --> 24:45.400
ASSISTANT PRODUCER KIM JI-UNG

24:47.694 --> 24:50.280
Do I have to keep working
with this stupid kid?

24:50.363 --> 24:53.283
- Mr. Park! Where are you?
- Yes?

24:54.993 --> 24:56.161
What is it?

24:57.120 --> 25:01.166
Don't take your anger out on him.
Come on, let's work together.

25:01.249 --> 25:02.918
We've been waiting for hours.

25:03.001 --> 25:05.587
He's the assistant producer,
but he's not doing anything.

25:05.670 --> 25:06.922
Are we going to shoot all night?

25:07.005 --> 25:08.882
Don't you see we're all working hard?

25:08.965 --> 25:13.011
I told you I have to end early today!
It's my wedding anniversary!

25:13.929 --> 25:17.015
I've never been able to go home
on my anniversaries.

25:17.098 --> 25:20.185
My wife might divorce me.
What are you going to do about that?

25:20.268 --> 25:22.479
I'll beg her to forgive you.

25:22.562 --> 25:23.813
Let's take a break.

25:23.897 --> 25:26.524
We should all eat something.

25:26.608 --> 25:28.777
Go and buy some ramyeon.

25:29.611 --> 25:32.322
If we had a smart assistant,
we would have ended early.

25:32.405 --> 25:33.782
What's the matter with you?

25:33.865 --> 25:35.075
We wasted the whole day!

25:36.534 --> 25:39.120
- Let's go for a smoke. Come on.
- Jeez.

25:39.871 --> 25:40.956
It's all my fault.

25:53.260 --> 25:54.678
Jeez.

25:54.761 --> 25:57.514
Is this a late-night snack or breakfast?

25:58.181 --> 26:00.600
- Is it done?
- Yes, you can eat now.

26:00.684 --> 26:01.893
Here you go.

26:02.686 --> 26:05.188
- What's this?
- They gave me some.

26:05.272 --> 26:06.690
It's clean, so it's okay.

26:06.773 --> 26:10.068
You should have gotten some crab
or squid instead.

26:10.151 --> 26:12.362
This is going to ruin the taste.

26:12.988 --> 26:15.907
You should eat seaweed on your birthday.

26:16.574 --> 26:17.867
Here you go.

26:17.951 --> 26:19.327
Is it your birthday?

26:19.411 --> 26:21.788
Hey, what's all this?

26:21.871 --> 26:25.166
What lunatic would put seaweed in ramyeon?

26:25.250 --> 26:26.710
- Just eat it.
- I'll pour it.

26:26.793 --> 26:28.878
It's fine. Give me your bowl.

26:29.921 --> 26:34.384
Eat up before it gets soggy.

26:35.093 --> 26:36.344
- Here.
- Eat up.

26:36.428 --> 26:37.345
Give me some too.

26:37.429 --> 26:38.596
Hey, happy birthday.

26:39.180 --> 26:40.181
Eat up.

26:41.933 --> 26:43.059
Thank you.

26:43.810 --> 26:44.811
Here.

26:44.894 --> 26:46.104
Thank you.

26:54.070 --> 26:56.197
They talk about the new market

26:57.032 --> 27:01.244
and how there are protests
on the news, but look.

27:02.078 --> 27:04.998
People are still
just living their daily lives.

27:07.625 --> 27:09.502
Our job is to record things like this.

27:10.128 --> 27:12.505
Things that people miss
because it seems so ordinary.

27:12.589 --> 27:15.216
People who live their ordinary lives

27:15.800 --> 27:18.845
and our daily lives as well.

27:18.928 --> 27:22.974
If we put them together,
they become stories about life.

27:24.893 --> 27:26.686
Don't be fooled.

27:26.770 --> 27:28.897
Run away while you're still young.

27:29.981 --> 27:34.194
Don't mess this up.
I have to convince him to stay!

27:38.239 --> 27:40.033
You're coming to work tomorrow, right?

27:43.620 --> 27:44.788
Eat up.

27:55.256 --> 27:56.466
What is it?

27:56.966 --> 28:00.136
- Putting seaweed in ramyeon…
- What about it?

28:01.137 --> 28:04.099
Ji-ung did that for me
when I was an assistant too.

28:04.182 --> 28:05.100
What?

28:08.478 --> 28:10.730
Did you fall for that too?

28:10.814 --> 28:13.858
Mr. Kim, that sly fox.
He used that to keep you here.

28:14.943 --> 28:19.280
I knew it. The documentary team
is much more fun than the drama team.

28:19.364 --> 28:22.784
WHILE THE CITY SLEEPS
GO-OH SOLO EXHIBIT

28:25.620 --> 28:27.247
EXHIBITION HOURS

28:41.219 --> 28:42.512
You may go in.

28:42.595 --> 28:43.555
Welcome.

28:43.638 --> 28:44.764
Enjoy the exhibit.

28:45.724 --> 28:46.933
Thank you for coming.

28:47.016 --> 28:48.101
Welcome.

28:48.184 --> 28:49.769
Enjoy the exhibit.

28:50.395 --> 28:51.521
Enjoy the exhibit.

28:55.233 --> 28:57.944
LEADERSHIP TRAINING CO-OP SEMINAR

28:58.027 --> 28:58.903
GO-OH'S SOLO EXHIBITION A SUCCESS

28:58.987 --> 29:00.488
You're very impressive, Ung.

29:01.656 --> 29:02.490
UNG

29:05.243 --> 29:06.077
Hey.

29:06.161 --> 29:07.328
Did you get off work?

29:07.412 --> 29:09.372
Yes, I'm heading home now.

29:09.456 --> 29:12.083
I saw the article.
You look really nice today.

29:13.334 --> 29:16.671
There are more people than I expected.
I'm a bit nervous.

29:17.255 --> 29:19.507
You did well at the drawing show
despite the crowd.

29:19.591 --> 29:21.926
You seemed to enjoy the attention.

29:22.010 --> 29:25.472
Gosh, I just want to finish this quickly
and stay home with you.

29:26.139 --> 29:27.348
Ung!

29:28.391 --> 29:31.394
I should get going.
You're coming on the last day, right?

29:31.478 --> 29:34.022
Yes. I'll give you
the most enthusiastic congratulations.

29:34.898 --> 29:35.940
I miss you, Yeon-su.

29:36.858 --> 29:37.942
Bye.

29:42.572 --> 29:45.617
Do you have regular working hours?
How many hours do you work a day?

29:45.700 --> 29:48.203
It differs depending
on the building's size and shape,

29:48.286 --> 29:50.872
but I work
around 12 hours a day on average.

29:50.955 --> 29:53.875
It's something
I can draw with a lot of detail.

29:53.958 --> 29:56.336
The height I prefer the most is 35 feet.

30:14.729 --> 30:16.981
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.

30:23.822 --> 30:25.240
- Hello.
- Hello.

30:27.575 --> 30:28.535
I'm a little nervous.

30:28.618 --> 30:30.203
Hello.

31:13.746 --> 31:17.166
Please check the routes
the customers take.

31:17.250 --> 31:19.127
- All right.
- If you come this way,

31:19.210 --> 31:21.713
I'll show you
where they'll hold the book talk.

31:23.798 --> 31:26.050
We'll do the book talk here.

31:26.134 --> 31:27.760
Send me the seating arrangements.

31:27.844 --> 31:30.763
And the author prefers communicating
with people close up,

31:30.847 --> 31:33.182
- so I think a circle would be good.
- All right.

31:33.266 --> 31:37.729
And I updated the location
for the drama shoot, so share that.

31:37.812 --> 31:38.646
- Okay.
- Okay.

31:38.730 --> 31:40.398
Let's do the seats in a circle.

31:41.399 --> 31:44.611
You all know it's the last day
of Go-oh's exhibit, right?

31:44.694 --> 31:47.906
- Did you all get tickets?
- I went last night with my girlfriend.

31:47.989 --> 31:50.658
- It was so nice.
- Really?

31:50.742 --> 31:51.784
Lucky you.

31:53.202 --> 31:55.496
I would have gone
if I had a girlfriend too.

31:55.580 --> 31:58.374
Is Ye-in busy? She probably
doesn't have anyone to go with.

31:58.458 --> 31:59.626
I should go with her.

32:08.927 --> 32:10.261
I thought you were a ghost!

32:26.069 --> 32:28.613
Why are you looking at me like that?

32:29.405 --> 32:33.326
Well, it seems like
you've changed a lot recently.

32:33.409 --> 32:35.453
You seem a bit warmer,

32:35.536 --> 32:37.580
not that you were cold or anything.

32:37.664 --> 32:39.916
You even joined us
for the gathering last time.

32:39.999 --> 32:42.460
You seem to be in a good mood these days.

32:42.543 --> 32:44.212
- Right? She looks really happy.
- Yes.

32:44.295 --> 32:46.297
- So…
- You're dating someone, right?

32:46.839 --> 32:48.007
Who is it?

32:49.425 --> 32:51.636
What are you trying to say?

32:52.387 --> 32:56.933
We're just curious what kind of person
changed you like this.

32:57.016 --> 32:58.810
And whether it's someone we know.

32:58.893 --> 33:01.646
We were wondering if it's Mr. Jang.

33:03.231 --> 33:07.485
We just wanted to know
how cool of a guy he is.

33:08.778 --> 33:11.406
Well, this is about my private life.

33:11.489 --> 33:13.282
Let's only talk about work.

33:13.366 --> 33:14.450
- Right.
- Yes, of course.

33:14.534 --> 33:17.745
I'll meet the staff and finish up here.

33:18.413 --> 33:19.497
- Okay.
- Yes.

33:21.916 --> 33:23.960
- And Myeong-ho.
- Yes?

33:24.043 --> 33:26.421
- Come with Ye-in later.
- Where?

33:26.504 --> 33:28.256
To my boyfriend's exhibit.

33:28.339 --> 33:31.217
You'll regret it if you don't come
since it's the last day.

33:34.804 --> 33:35.888
Boyfriend?

33:37.473 --> 33:38.599
Go-oh?

33:46.566 --> 33:48.943
Ji-ung. You've got to stop.

33:52.155 --> 33:53.489
Should I stop eating?

33:54.824 --> 33:56.743
That's not what I'm talking about.

33:56.826 --> 33:57.869
Stop what, then?

33:58.453 --> 34:00.538
Moping around like that.

34:03.875 --> 34:04.959
Sit down.

34:09.172 --> 34:10.757
And "moping"?

34:11.466 --> 34:13.676
Is that a way to talk to your superior?

34:14.260 --> 34:17.180
I was just going to leave you be,

34:17.263 --> 34:18.848
but you're going too far.

34:20.308 --> 34:23.019
I know you're having a hard time
because you're heartbroken,

34:23.102 --> 34:26.230
but it's not something to brood over
for this long. You're a grown-up.

34:27.523 --> 34:29.400
Right, I was rejected too.

34:30.026 --> 34:31.402
Thanks for rubbing it in.

34:32.278 --> 34:33.696
That really hurts.

34:36.365 --> 34:39.035
Weren't you acting like this
because of Ms. Kook?

34:39.744 --> 34:42.538
You shouldn't mention names like that.

34:44.290 --> 34:46.584
Then why aren't you going home?

34:47.460 --> 34:49.128
Because I don't want to go home.

34:49.712 --> 34:50.880
Why?

34:51.506 --> 34:52.715
Just because.

34:53.800 --> 34:55.093
Did something happen?

34:56.052 --> 34:57.553
Are you interrogating me?

34:57.637 --> 34:59.347
You're Mr. Park's spy, aren't you?

34:59.430 --> 35:01.516
You're making me worried.

35:02.642 --> 35:05.228
I get that you tend to
push yourself when you work,

35:05.812 --> 35:08.397
but you're doing work
that you don't even have to do.

35:08.481 --> 35:12.235
You're the one who told me
not to make a habit of working overnight.

35:12.318 --> 35:13.861
So why aren't you going home?

35:18.866 --> 35:20.952
Thanks for worrying about me.

35:26.124 --> 35:27.834
But don't get so upset.

35:28.501 --> 35:31.420
People are saying
you're starting to act like me.

35:33.506 --> 35:37.552
Then you should take care of yourself
so I won't worry.

35:38.136 --> 35:39.303
All right, fine.

35:39.887 --> 35:42.473
I can't even work late anymore
because of your nagging.

35:43.141 --> 35:44.559
It's not that--

35:44.642 --> 35:46.894
Just eat. It'll get cold.

36:08.583 --> 36:09.625
Yes?

36:10.293 --> 36:12.086
Yes. What is it?

36:39.071 --> 36:42.283
The way you look at me
makes me pretty sad.

36:43.492 --> 36:46.746
No, I was just startled.
I didn't expect you to come.

36:47.413 --> 36:48.915
Thanks for coming.

36:48.998 --> 36:52.043
Don't be ridiculous.
I got a formal invitation.

36:52.126 --> 36:53.127
You asked me to come.

36:56.339 --> 36:59.634
What? You didn't send this?

37:00.343 --> 37:03.304
My gosh.
I didn't think I'd become so pathetic.

37:03.387 --> 37:05.306
No, I did send it.

37:05.389 --> 37:06.807
Right?

37:07.433 --> 37:10.061
I was living a busy life
and I totally forgot about you.

37:10.144 --> 37:11.729
But I came because you asked.

37:13.189 --> 37:14.357
Were you

37:15.107 --> 37:17.193
waiting for someone?

37:18.110 --> 37:20.321
Oh, I guess she's a bit late.

37:20.947 --> 37:22.198
Ms. Kook Yeon-su?

37:24.283 --> 37:27.453
She's still not here?
Your girlfriend's totally neglecting you.

37:27.536 --> 37:30.081
If you had dated me, this wouldn't happen…

37:31.415 --> 37:34.460
Hey, that was a joke. You should smile.

37:37.296 --> 37:40.591
These flowers are so pretty. Thank you.

37:41.300 --> 37:43.010
I'm always the one giving you flowers.

37:43.094 --> 37:45.721
I was used to accepting them all the time.

37:49.809 --> 37:51.686
Your drawings are still really nice.

37:51.769 --> 37:53.521
Were there a lot of people?

37:54.105 --> 37:56.941
There were a lot before you came,

37:57.483 --> 38:01.070
but there aren't any now.
Maybe it's too late at night.

38:01.153 --> 38:03.781
Oh, I bought the tickets for this hour.

38:04.949 --> 38:06.033
What?

38:06.701 --> 38:07.785
I bought all the tickets.

38:08.786 --> 38:09.620
What?

38:10.579 --> 38:13.124
They say there are two ways
to make friends.

38:13.708 --> 38:16.127
Spend a lot of time with them,
or make an impression.

38:16.210 --> 38:20.089
But for me, making an impression
is faster than spending time with them.

38:21.757 --> 38:22.883
You were touched, right?

38:23.551 --> 38:25.761
I know. Well, then…

38:27.346 --> 38:29.557
Let's be friends. For real this time.

38:31.058 --> 38:34.103
You're more unusual than I thought.

38:34.979 --> 38:36.397
Someone told me that

38:36.981 --> 38:39.233
if I want to live a normal life,
I can just pretend to.

38:39.942 --> 38:42.194
So I'm going to make friends
like a normal person.

38:42.987 --> 38:45.990
This isn't normal at all though.

38:46.073 --> 38:46.991
Anyway…

38:47.825 --> 38:49.952
are you going to leave me hanging?

38:50.036 --> 38:51.370
Oh, sorry.

38:57.501 --> 38:58.711
Do you…

39:00.379 --> 39:02.048
give discounts to your friends?

39:03.090 --> 39:04.133
Of course.

39:07.428 --> 39:10.556
Our editing room ghost is finally leaving!
Round of applause!

39:10.639 --> 39:11.974
Come on, clap.

39:13.559 --> 39:15.478
Go home. I hope I never see you again.

39:15.561 --> 39:17.688
I get treated so badly
even if I work so hard.

39:17.772 --> 39:21.567
You don't have to work so hard,
so sleep at home, all right?

39:21.650 --> 39:23.652
Your water and electricity
will get cut soon.

39:23.736 --> 39:25.488
Don't exaggerate.

39:25.571 --> 39:26.614
Ji-ung.

39:28.074 --> 39:30.159
How about we go out for some drinks?

39:30.242 --> 39:32.995
- No.
- I knew it. Get lost.

39:33.079 --> 39:35.498
I'm sick of staying here with you.
I'll drink with…

39:35.581 --> 39:37.541
Hey, where did he go?

39:37.625 --> 39:38.584
Mr. Park.

39:38.667 --> 39:39.835
You should go home too.

39:39.919 --> 39:41.670
It's scary. Nobody's home.

39:42.671 --> 39:44.298
- Bye.
- Ji-ung.

39:48.761 --> 39:51.555
Is something up?

39:52.890 --> 39:54.058
No.

40:13.911 --> 40:16.497
Is Yeon-su still not here?
We have to close soon.

40:17.081 --> 40:19.041
- No.
- Should I start wrapping up?

40:19.625 --> 40:20.960
Okay.

40:37.268 --> 40:41.063
You're so strange. How could you think
of doing an exhibit at this hour?

40:46.444 --> 40:47.611
I enjoyed your exhibit.

40:48.195 --> 40:49.363
They're still good,

40:50.197 --> 40:51.824
but there's still no advancement.

40:53.409 --> 40:55.161
Did you come here to say that?

40:55.744 --> 40:56.579
Jeez.

40:57.079 --> 40:58.622
Stop following me around.

41:00.624 --> 41:02.251
Did you sell some drawings?

41:02.334 --> 41:04.837
I have no time for you. Just go.

41:05.337 --> 41:07.590
You can read it on the news
that you love so much.

41:09.842 --> 41:11.093
You're so annoying.

41:15.764 --> 41:19.560
You never said anything
about the plagiarism though.

41:19.643 --> 41:22.146
Yes. I'm not interested.

41:25.149 --> 41:26.317
I'll leave then.

41:28.194 --> 41:29.904
What makes you think you're all that?

41:34.533 --> 41:36.911
Do you feel like your life is
all elegant and special

41:36.994 --> 41:38.746
if you ignore everything?

41:39.788 --> 41:40.956
What?

41:43.709 --> 41:45.586
I stole your drawing.

41:53.385 --> 41:54.470
Hey, Tae-seon.

41:55.596 --> 41:58.140
Did you decide what to hand in?
Are you finished?

41:58.807 --> 41:59.767
Yes, I did.

42:01.268 --> 42:04.396
Hey, this is awesome.

42:07.358 --> 42:11.111
But this seems
a bit similar to Ung's drawings.

42:15.699 --> 42:17.117
Really?

42:20.538 --> 42:22.289
Hey, Ung. Do you think so too?

42:23.541 --> 42:26.544
Let me see yours. Wouldn't it be
bad if they're too similar?

42:29.838 --> 42:31.131
I can draw a new one.

42:31.215 --> 42:34.093
A new one? The deadline's tomorrow!

42:35.052 --> 42:36.303
If I'm late, too bad.

42:45.563 --> 42:48.399
What makes you think you're so special
even back then and now?

42:49.733 --> 42:51.318
That's funny.

42:51.402 --> 42:53.946
Is that really something
you should be asking me?

42:54.029 --> 42:55.698
That face again.

42:56.240 --> 42:57.741
That mocking look.

42:58.534 --> 43:00.494
Why? Do you need more attention?

43:00.578 --> 43:02.913
You pretend
not to be interested in anything.

43:04.999 --> 43:06.208
Well…

43:07.418 --> 43:10.713
things must have seemed easy
for you since you had everything.

43:10.796 --> 43:14.300
But still, you shouldn't have been
so obvious about it.

43:15.217 --> 43:18.804
That makes the people around you
trying their best lose their spirit.

43:21.056 --> 43:22.099
It's really annoying.

43:23.267 --> 43:26.604
So the best you could do
was copy my drawings?

43:31.275 --> 43:32.651
I was curious

43:32.735 --> 43:35.362
how you'd react
after getting something of yours stolen.

43:36.905 --> 43:38.240
But…

43:38.824 --> 43:42.119
seeing that you
still had that look on your face…

43:44.038 --> 43:45.456
made me pity you.

43:52.630 --> 43:53.714
What?

43:54.381 --> 43:57.051
It seemed like
your life was so meaningless

43:57.676 --> 43:59.261
that you could abandon anything.

44:01.013 --> 44:04.642
What would be left of your life
if you lived like that?

44:10.689 --> 44:12.358
I really can't stand to hear this.

44:13.359 --> 44:17.112
You don't have the right
to talk to him like that, you thief.

44:17.863 --> 44:22.368
I knew it. You admitted it yourself
that you plagiarized him.

44:22.451 --> 44:26.121
I'm going to tell all the reporters
about this. You just wait and see.

44:28.165 --> 44:30.417
Your drawings are actually pretty boring.

44:33.587 --> 44:34.755
They're all empty.

45:14.795 --> 45:17.089
Why are you still here?

45:18.173 --> 45:20.843
You should go see Ung.

45:23.345 --> 45:26.515
Didn't you hear the doctor?

45:27.099 --> 45:29.059
I'm fine.

45:30.477 --> 45:31.478
Go on.

45:32.271 --> 45:33.856
I'm going to get some more sleep.

45:36.817 --> 45:38.068
My goodness.

45:39.027 --> 45:42.406
You get hospitalized
once in a while at this age.

45:42.489 --> 45:44.575
It's no big deal, so go on.

45:46.493 --> 45:47.953
You're doing this on purpose.

45:50.289 --> 45:51.498
Yeon-su.

45:52.416 --> 45:54.251
You're going to leave me.

45:54.960 --> 45:56.128
You're…

45:58.714 --> 45:59.965
getting ready to leave me.

46:03.886 --> 46:05.679
Listen to me carefully, Yeon-su.

46:06.972 --> 46:09.183
You know how tough I am.

46:09.266 --> 46:11.977
I'm going to live a long life.

46:12.644 --> 46:15.189
Even if the grim reaper comes for me,

46:15.272 --> 46:18.066
I'm going to hold on and stay here.

46:20.694 --> 46:21.945
I'm just…

46:25.699 --> 46:27.284
scared…

46:28.577 --> 46:30.871
that maybe, just maybe…

46:32.331 --> 46:35.626
I might end up leaving you all alone.

46:36.335 --> 46:38.837
Don't say that, Grandma.

46:39.880 --> 46:41.507
I can't live without you.

46:42.132 --> 46:43.342
You need to.

46:44.343 --> 46:46.094
You have to live even without me.

46:46.720 --> 46:50.307
You have to eat well
and do everything you want to do.

46:50.891 --> 46:52.351
You must.

46:55.437 --> 46:57.147
But do you know what I think

46:58.023 --> 47:00.359
when I look at you?

47:07.366 --> 47:10.786
That I'm being punished

47:11.912 --> 47:13.789
by having you live like me.

47:23.090 --> 47:25.259
All I need is you, Grandma.

47:26.843 --> 47:29.054
And all you need is me.

47:29.137 --> 47:32.849
- We've lived happily together--
- All I need is you.

47:33.934 --> 47:37.646
Because all I have left is to grow older.

47:38.605 --> 47:40.941
You're the only one I need.

47:42.067 --> 47:43.318
But you…

47:45.028 --> 47:47.906
Don't live like me.

47:50.742 --> 47:53.412
Keep people close to you,

47:54.788 --> 47:57.791
do things that you want to do,

47:58.917 --> 48:01.795
and enjoy your life.

48:04.256 --> 48:07.342
Don't live just for me, Yeon-su.

48:16.935 --> 48:18.520
That way

48:19.521 --> 48:22.649
I won't be ashamed to face
your parents when I leave.

48:46.089 --> 48:48.842
Oh, hey! Gu Eun-ho!

48:48.925 --> 48:50.469
Hey, Sol-i.

48:50.552 --> 48:51.553
Where are you going?

48:52.888 --> 48:54.348
Is the exhibit over?

48:54.431 --> 48:56.224
Yes. Did you close the bar?

48:57.100 --> 48:58.101
Yes.

48:58.185 --> 48:59.353
Right.

48:59.895 --> 49:01.229
What's with that face?

49:01.313 --> 49:04.358
Shouldn't you be throwing a party
to celebrate the end of the exhibit?

49:04.441 --> 49:07.319
- I'm not in the mood.
- Why?

49:08.695 --> 49:11.073
But where's Ung? Why are you alone?

49:31.927 --> 49:34.429
The person you have called…

49:46.316 --> 49:47.275
Where are you?

50:15.053 --> 50:18.682
I respect you for trying to drink
when you can't handle your alcohol.

50:24.396 --> 50:26.022
How economical.

50:26.773 --> 50:28.734
Are you drunk after drinking this little?

50:29.735 --> 50:31.027
I'm fine.

50:32.904 --> 50:35.323
You've picked up bad drinking habits.

50:46.001 --> 50:48.170
Should I match your level of drunkenness?

50:48.253 --> 50:50.922
I'll catch up if I drink all this.

50:51.840 --> 50:54.551
- Don't act so tough.
- What? You don't believe me?

50:55.177 --> 50:57.137
- I'll show you.
- No, don't.

50:57.220 --> 50:59.514
I didn't call you so you'd get drunk.
This is mine.

51:01.975 --> 51:03.143
Don't be so cheap.

51:17.949 --> 51:18.992
Hey.

51:20.869 --> 51:23.789
It's been quite a while
since we drank together like this.

51:26.583 --> 51:27.542
Right.

51:31.129 --> 51:33.590
My exhibit was until today.
Why didn't you come?

51:36.802 --> 51:38.053
I was busy.

51:40.180 --> 51:41.431
That's a simple answer.

51:42.390 --> 51:44.893
I'm actually pretty upset with you.

51:49.981 --> 51:51.149
What about now?

51:51.983 --> 51:53.443
Are you free?

51:55.320 --> 51:57.739
I finished a week's worth of work
in advance.

51:58.323 --> 52:03.161
The people around you will hate you
if you work so much like that.

52:10.085 --> 52:11.002
Hey.

52:15.674 --> 52:17.425
My mom's going to die.

52:37.237 --> 52:38.446
But…

52:41.491 --> 52:43.410
I don't feel sad at all.

53:02.012 --> 53:03.513
How pitiful.

53:05.807 --> 53:06.725
Who?

53:09.895 --> 53:12.439
Just… Everyone.

53:18.403 --> 53:19.487
Us…

53:21.323 --> 53:22.657
and everyone.

54:54.541 --> 54:55.542
Excuse me.

54:56.251 --> 54:57.669
Do you need any help?

55:00.547 --> 55:01.881
Who are you here to see?

55:15.311 --> 55:16.312
Yeon-su!

55:26.740 --> 55:28.616
What are you doing out here in the cold?

55:31.453 --> 55:32.662
I…

55:33.997 --> 55:35.290
I thought…

55:35.999 --> 55:39.044
I ruined everything again.

55:40.503 --> 55:42.130
What are you talking about?

55:42.213 --> 55:43.965
How long have you been here?

55:44.966 --> 55:46.259
I thought

55:47.343 --> 55:49.387
I ruined everything again.

55:52.182 --> 55:53.475
I'm sorry, Ung.

55:54.893 --> 55:56.519
I'm sorry.

55:57.812 --> 55:58.980
I'm sorry.

56:03.902 --> 56:06.696
I told you that won't ever happen.

56:09.240 --> 56:11.826
You're not going to ruin anything.

56:19.292 --> 56:20.335
Ung.

56:21.169 --> 56:22.003
Yes.

56:25.381 --> 56:26.966
I'm in so much pain.

56:39.062 --> 56:40.230
I…

56:41.356 --> 56:43.650
I'm in so much pain right now.

56:48.947 --> 56:49.948
Okay.

57:05.755 --> 57:07.465
Why are you looking so down?

57:09.134 --> 57:10.969
Didn't the exhibit end well?

57:11.553 --> 57:12.679
It was a disaster.

57:12.762 --> 57:13.805
What?

57:15.098 --> 57:17.433
A famous critic criticized him harshly.

57:18.017 --> 57:19.144
Why?

57:19.644 --> 57:21.062
The drawings seemed cool.

57:22.814 --> 57:24.232
What did they say?

57:27.485 --> 57:31.156
Ung is going to need
a lot of comforting today.

57:36.244 --> 57:38.079
HOW LONG WILL GO-OH
STAY TRAPPED IN HIS OWN WORLD?

57:38.163 --> 57:40.874
GO-OH HAS HELD
AN INNOVATIVE NIGHT-TIME EXHIBITION

57:40.957 --> 57:42.834
GO-OH DRAWS DETAILED
ILLUSTRATIONS OF BUILDINGS…

57:42.917 --> 57:47.046
BUT THERE IS IMMATURITY
HIDDEN BEHIND HIS TECHNICAL PROWESS

57:50.800 --> 57:53.678
"His drawings that show his emotions

57:54.512 --> 57:56.139
are just like doodles

57:57.140 --> 57:59.517
of a child trapped in his own world."

58:16.451 --> 58:17.702
Let's go inside.

58:26.127 --> 58:33.134
THREE IDIOTS

58:51.444 --> 58:58.451
EPILOGUE

59:04.374 --> 59:06.668
I want to go with you.

59:13.925 --> 59:18.930
Subtitle translation by: Ju-young Park
